WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.307
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Clinic aur Doctor ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:06.307 --> 00:00:09.142
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:18.851
Clinic ka kaam appointment se shuru hota hai, phir consultation ke baad prescription aur treatment plan tak jaata hai, aur ant mein bill.

00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:22.521
Ye Appointments screen hai, aaj ki patient list.

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:28.833
Har line mein samay, patient ka naam, mobile, doctor aur kaaran, jaise bukhar ya knee pain.

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:32.163
Status: Completed, Arrived, Confirmed ya Booked.

00:00:32.163 --> 00:00:37.018
Jo patient aa gaya uske saamne Write prescription ka button hai. Kyun?

00:00:37.018 --> 00:00:45.203
Kyunki reception aur doctor ko ek hi list dikhti hai, aur waiting room mein kaun baitha hai ye turant pata chalta hai.

00:00:45.581 --> 00:00:52.605
Ab ek naya prescription likhte hain. Patient ka naam Suresh Patil, mobile number, umar bayalees saal.

00:00:52.605 --> 00:00:58.934
Patient pehle aaya ho to upar search se uski purani details aur history aa jaati hai. Kyun?

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:03.872
Kyunki har baar naam number dubara likhne mein doctor ka time jata hai.

00:01:04.241 --> 00:01:09.800
Complaints mein bukhar aur gale mein dard, do din se. Neeche diagnosis aur advice.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:21.866
Kuch specialty ke liye extra fields bhi aate hain, jaise cardiology mein blood pressure aur vitals ka panel, dental mein tooth chart, aur bachchon ke doctor ke liye growth chart.

00:01:21.866 --> 00:01:25.052
Ye Prescription pad settings se chalu hota hai.

00:01:25.437 --> 00:01:31.918
Ab dawai. Naam likhte hi library se suggestion aati hai, jo pehle likhi ja chuki hai.

00:01:31.918 --> 00:01:39.009
Paracetamol, dose paanch sau milligram. Din mein kitni baar, ek zero ek yaani subah aur raat.

00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:44.652
Kitne din, paanch din. Khane ke baad. Plus Add medicine dabate hain. Kyun?

00:01:44.652 --> 00:01:52.048
Kyunki dawai ka naam, dose aur samay saaf likha ho to pharmacy aur patient dono galti nahi karte.

00:01:52.422 --> 00:01:54.514
Follow up ki tareekh bhi yahin.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:02:02.813
Aur ye combination aage baar baar likhna ho to Save as template dabao, agli baar ek tap mein pura prescription bhar jayega.

00:02:02.813 --> 00:02:10.033
Kyun? Kyunki common bimariyon ke liye wahi dawai baar baar likhni padti hai, aur template isse bachata hai.

00:02:10.411 --> 00:02:13.210
Save and print prescription dabate hain.

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:24.826
Dekhiye, prescription clinic ke apne letterhead par bana hai: doctor ka naam, degree, registration number upar, patient ki details, dawai ka table, aur neeche footer.

00:02:24.826 --> 00:02:28.744
Ye print ke liye taiyar hai, ya PDF ban sakta hai. Kyun?

00:02:28.744 --> 00:02:34.902
Kyunki chhape hue pad ki zaroorat nahi, aur har prescription saaf aur ek jaisa aata hai.

00:02:35.271 --> 00:02:39.122
Isi page ke neeche consultation ka bill bhi ban jata hai.

00:02:39.122 --> 00:02:43.109
Fees likhte hain, teen sau rupaye, aur Generate bill. Kyun?

00:02:43.109 --> 00:02:49.122
Kyunki prescription se bill tak ek hi jagah, doosri machine ya register ki zaroorat nahi.

00:02:49.489 --> 00:02:55.828
Ab Treatment Plans. Ye badi ya lambi treatment ke liye hain, jaise dental ka kaam.

00:02:55.828 --> 00:03:02.554
List mein plan aur uski halat, In progress ya Billed. Meera Chavan ka plan kholte hain.

00:03:02.554 --> 00:03:06.420
Isme teen treatments hain aur kul saat sau rupaye.

00:03:09.039 --> 00:03:16.337
Print ya share quotation dabate hain to patient ko pehle se likha hua estimate mil jata hai, taaki wo tay kar sake.

00:03:16.337 --> 00:03:20.272
Fir jaise jaise treatment hoti hai, use tick karte jaate hain.

00:03:20.272 --> 00:03:24.715
Aur ant mein Convert to bill se poore plan ka bill ban jata hai. Kyun?

00:03:24.715 --> 00:03:30.490
Kyunki plan, quotation aur bill teeno ek hi record hain, koi baat dobara nahi likhni padti.

00:03:31.704 --> 00:03:37.996
Medicine Library. Jo dawai aap ne prescription mein likhi, wo yahan apne aap save ho jaati hai.

00:03:37.996 --> 00:03:41.506
Agli baar naam type nahi karna, sirf search se chuno.

00:03:41.506 --> 00:03:46.540
Aap apni list CSV ya Excel se upload bhi kar sakte ho, aur export bhi. Kyun?

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:52.435
Kyunki dawai ka naam galat type hone se galti ho sakti hai, aur library usse bachati hai.

00:03:52.804 --> 00:03:59.316
Prescription pad settings. Yahan specialty chunte hain, jaise dental, cardiology ya bachchon ke doctor.

00:03:59.316 --> 00:04:03.047
Header mein doctor ka naam, degree aur registration number.

00:04:03.047 --> 00:04:10.887
Letterhead banner aur footer ka stamp upload kar sakte ho, aur prescription par kaunse fields chhapein, ye tay kar sakte ho.

00:04:10.887 --> 00:04:16.135
Kyun? Kyunki har doctor ka pad alag hota hai, aur ye app us pad jaisa hi banta hai.

00:04:16.501 --> 00:04:17.619
Aur online booking.

00:04:17.619 --> 00:04:24.090
Ek link jo patient ko WhatsApp par bhej sakte ho, aur wo apne aap slot chun kar appointment book kar leta hai.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:28.326
Kaam ke ghante, aur appointments ke beech ka gap aap tay karte ho. Kyun?

00:04:28.326 --> 00:04:35.032
Kyunki phone par appointment dene mein reception ka time jaata hai, aur booking link raat mein bhi kaam karta hai.

00:04:35.407 --> 00:04:51.332
Aaj humne Clinic ka flow dekha: appointments, prescription vitals aur complaints ke saath, dawai ka dose, letterhead par print, consultation ka bill, treatment plan se quotation aur bill, medicine library, pad settings aur online booking.

00:04:51.332 --> 00:04:56.351
Ek practical baat: har prescription mein follow up ki tareekh zaroor likho.

00:04:56.351 --> 00:05:00.098
Patient ko wapas bulane ka sabse aasan tareeka wahi hai.
